<title>OMAN: Oman's Al Ahlia Insurance lifts 96 pre-tax - paper.</title>
<headline>Oman's Al Ahlia Insurance lifts 96 pre-tax - paper.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Al Ahlia Insurance Co lifted pre-tax profit to some 723,000 rials last year from 1995's 634,000 rials, the Times of Oman newspaper reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The paper said the board, at the annual general meeting on Sunday, recommended a dividend equal to 15 percent of capital.</p>
